Session A:
T1: first read of Alice balance
+----+------------+---------+
| id | owner_name | balance |
+----+------------+---------+
|  1 | Alice      |     100 |
+----+------------+---------+

Session B:
T2: committed Alice balance = 150
+----+------------+---------+
| id | owner_name | balance |
+----+------------+---------+
|  1 | Alice      |     150 |
+----+------------+---------+

Session A:
T1: second read of the same row in the same transaction
+----+------------+---------+
| id | owner_name | balance |
+----+------------+---------+
|  1 | Alice      |     150 |
+----+------------+---------+

Result: one transaction read the same row twice and got different values.
